      {
        "finding": "Within harmful-source tasks, every method labels all actions unsafe on Qwen and Gemma, giving 0% accuracy on safe actions. On Llama that accuracy is 1.23–7.98%.",
        "proposed_claim": "Action screeners key on task intent rather than action-level safety, and aggregate unsafe F1 hides this.",
        "row_ids": [
          "R23",
