    "problems": "Safety classification is an offline, instructed screening task on fixed candidate actions and is not a refusal-behavior test. No uncertainty estimates are stated for the reported metrics. The authors note that aggregate metrics can hide failure on safe actions from harmful-source tasks.",
    "rows_left_out": "No results were left out from the safety-awareness results recorded here. Results from instruction following, tool use, mathematical reasoning, and reasoning-length control were omitted because they do not measure refusal or the refusal direction.",
